=== DATE_PART equivalence (PG alias) ===
SELECT DATE_PART('century',    TIMESTAMP '2024-05-19 14:30:45')
     = EXTRACT(CENTURY FROM TIMESTAMP '2024-05-19 14:30:45')   AS date_part_century_eq;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'CENTURY FROM TIMESTAMP '2024-05-19 14:30:45')   AS date_part_century_eq' at line 2
SELECT DATE_PART('decade',     TIMESTAMP '2024-05-19 14:30:45')
     = EXTRACT(DECADE FROM TIMESTAMP '2024-05-19 14:30:45')    AS date_part_decade_eq;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'DECADE FROM TIMESTAMP '2024-05-19 14:30:45')    AS date_part_decade_eq' at line 2
